(89,1,'Wiki Help :: NL','Wiki Help','wiki_help::nl','Inserts a line break into the page.','@@HideFooterComments @@HideFooterLastModified @@protect(true)\r\n##title @@Tags(Official-Help, Help, Wiki, Official, Standard Function)\r\n##toc\r\n${metaColor = #ee2401}\r\n${keywordColor = #318000}\r\n${identifierColor = #c6680e}\r\n==Overview\r\nThe NL standard function inserts a line break into the page.\r\n\r\n\r\n==Prototype\r\n##Color(${keywordColor}, **#{ ##NL }#**)(##Color(${keywordColor}, numeric) [##Color(${identifierColor}, count)])\r\n\r\n\r\n===Parameters\r\n{{Bullets\r\n**Name:** ##Color(${identifierColor}, count) ##Color(${metaColor}, [Required])\r\n>**Type:** ##Color(${keywordColor}, numeric)\r\n>**Default:** ##Color(${identifierColor}, 1)\r\n>**Description:** The number of line breaks to insert.\r\n}}\r\n\r\n==Examples\r\n{{Code(wiki)#{\r\n##NL(count)\r\n}#}}\r\n\r\n==See Also\r\n[[Wiki Help :: Function Calling Convention]]\r\n[[Wiki Help :: Scope Function]]\r\n[[Wiki Help :: Instruction Function]]\r\n[[Wiki Help :: Standard Function]]\r\n\r\n\r\n==Related\r\n##related(list)\r\n',1496351924,'Built-in default content','75f212c8-0a43-4ef9-bb11-aff3de1b9dbd','2026-10-09 23:03:33.006689'),
